# As correlate-gnn, with the gate on the full kinematic state (the `state`
# test, Bar-Shalom 1981) in place of the position-only gate: position and
# velocity per axis, and height when both tracks report it, inside the 99 %
# region (chi-square quantile for 4 or 5 degrees of freedom). Height error
# 100 m per track. Other values as in correlate-gnn.
pack           correlate-gnn-state
version        1.0.0
filter         accel_var=1 default_ce_m=50 vel_sigma_ms=5 unknown_vel_ms=100
gate           state probability=0.99 hae_sigma_m=100
gate           same key=@env
confirm_count  2
hold           mahalanobis gate=18.42
hold_failures  2
stale_ms       60000
output         fused
